; Sony's PlayStation 2 Multitap (SCPH-10090): a black ribbed box, A and B on one
; long face and C and D on the other, each a controller socket under a memory
; card slot, and one cord from a short end whose connector fills a console's
; controller port and the card slot above it. Built in code; see
; ps2_multitap.gd, which also places CableAttachPoint (its -Z out of the -X end).
